## Identity rules

**Ingestion runs in identity order — the minting system first.** This is a hard dependency, not a preference.

| Entity | Minted by | Referenced by | Key | Stable? | On disagreement |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| | S1 | S2, S3 | | | survivorship rule + adjudicator |

